        "description": "Marks a finding as a false positive or accepted risk, with a reason, or opens it again. The decision follows the fingerprint to every branch, so a pull request that adds the same finding does not fail. A finding that is only in a pull request can be triaged too.\n\nNeeds the editor role.",
